Source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/openai/codex/rust-v0.164.0/codex-rs/models-manager/models.json
Modified by TRACE-RPG contributors on 2026-10-26. This separately scoped extension catalog contains only gpt-6-luna, gpt-6-sol, gpt-5.6-luna, gpt-5.6-sol, and gpt-5.6-terra. Only model tool-capability metadata was changed: apply_patch_tool_type=null, experimental_supported_tools=[], tool_mode=direct, multi_agent_version=null. Model IDs, model messages, base instructions, reasoning settings, and every other model field are preserved. This catalog is admitted only by the runtime-model-swap/assignment-plan/2 and runtime-native-activation/3 extension path; it does not alter the legacy catalog.
The full source license is in codex_model_metadata.LICENSE.
